New: Already-imported decks can now be updated when the online version changes (e.g. new species) — without losing your review progress.
New: Before downloading the species database, the app now shows the approximate size, with an extra warning when you're on cellular.
New: First-run setup now leads straight into a full-screen deck picker instead of a welcome dialog.
New: Edit Deck now has a delete button, so you no longer have to go back to the deck list to swipe-delete a deck.
Fix: Scanning a deck-share QR code now actually imports the deck instead of always failing.
Change: Importing a deck via QR code or file/JSON now opens the create-deck screen pre-filled with the deck's values instead of importing it directly.
Fix: Scanning a QR code now shows a loading indicator right away, so the app no longer looks frozen while it's processing.
New: You're now notified when a species database update installs automatically over Wi-Fi, instead of it happening with no feedback.
